cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MetriLens in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MetriLens: Comparing the Energy Consumption of Functionally Equivalent Application Versions"
abstract: >-
  MetriLens measures and compares the energy consumption of two functionally equivalent versions
  of a Dockerized application under the same user-level workload, using METRION for thread-level
  energy attribution, and reports the difference with confidence intervals.
